)</span></td>\n<td>Uppflyttade från <a href=\"/wiki/Superettan_2016\" title=\"Superettan 2016\">Superettan 2016</a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&#160;<span class=\"noprint plainlinks\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:normal; font-size:80%; ;\">Denna tabell:&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Fotbollsallsvenskan_2017\" title=\"Mall:Poängtabell för Fotbollsallsvenskan 2017\"><span title=\"Visa denna mall\" style=\";\">visa</span></a>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:80%;\">•</span>&#160;<a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Fotbollsallsvenskan_2017&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Fotbollsallsvenskan_2017&amp;action=edit\"><span style=\";\" title=\"Redigera den här mallen\">redigera</span></a></span>&#160;<small>Tabell uppdaterad 5 november 2017</small><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-38\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-38\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>36<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"font-size:0.9375em;line-height:1.4em;text-align:center;background:white;margin-top:0.1em;\">\n<tbody><tr><th style=\"width:1.8em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help;\" title=\"Placering\">Nr</span> </th>\n<th style=\"width: 13em;\"> Lag </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Spelade matcher\">S</span></th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Vinster\">V</span>        </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Oavgjorda\">O</span>      </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Förluster\">F</span>      </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Gjorda mål\">GM</span>  